 is maximum, and", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.8242612752721618, "x1": 0.7791208791208791, "y1": 0.8367029548989113}, {"text": "verify that the maximum value of V is 500/3.", "x0": 0.30439560439560437, "y0": 0.8452566096423018, "x1": 0.7472527472527473, "y1": 0.8576982892690513}, {"text": "104", "x0": 0.4901098901098901, "y0": 0.9455676516329704, "x1": 0.5131868131868131, "y1": 0.9548989113530326}], [{"text": "Question 9.", "x0": 0.1043956043956044, "y0": 0.15163297045101087, "x1": 0.21208791208791208, "y1": 0.1640746500777605}, {"text": "(Use a separate book.)", "x0": 0.23736263736263735, "y0": 0.15163297045101087, "x1": 0.45384615384615384, "y1": 0.16485225505443235}, {"text": "\u00a2 minutes after a jet engine starts operation, the rate of", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.19517884914463451, "x1": 0.7791208791208791, "y1": 0.20684292379471228}, {"text": "(i)", "x0": 0.14615384615384616, "y0": 0.19595645412130638, "x1": 0.17032967032967034, "y1": 0.20684292379471228}, {"text": "fuel burn, R kg per minute, is given by the relation", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.21695178849144633, "x1": 0.7186813186813187, "y1": 0.2286158631415241}, {"text": "10", "x0": 0.34615384615384615, "y0": 0.2527216174183515, "x1": 0.3637362637362637, "y1": 0.2620528771384137}, {"text": "Re", "x0": 0.24395604395604395, "y0": 0.25894245723172626, "x1": 0.27472527472527475, "y1": 0.26749611197511663}, {"text": "10+", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.26049766718507, "x1": 0.3252747252747253, "y1": 0.2690513219284603}, {"text": "(a)", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.31726283048211507, "x1": 0.21978021978021978, "y1": 0.328149300155521}, {"text": "Draw a sketch of R as a function of t.", "x0": 0.24395604395604395, "y0": 0.31726283048211507, "x1": 0.6252747252747253, "y1": 0.3265940902021773}, {"text": "What is the rate of burn, 2, after 7 minutes?", "x0": 0.24285714285714285, "y0": 0.3522550544323484, "x1": 0.6967032967032967, "y1": 0.36391912908242613}, {"text": "(b)", "x0": 0.195